      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/indian-creek-77487",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1832, the Davis Settlement near Indian Creek was attacked during the Black Hawk War, killing 15 settlers.",
